<title>SPAIN: Colombia's Ocampo sees '97 GDP closer to 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Ocampo sees '97 GDP closer to 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA, Spain 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Jose Antonio Ocampo said on Monday that Colombia's GDP growth would probably be closer to 5.0 percent than the 4.0 to 4.5 percent originally forecast.</p>
<p>&quot;Most estimates were between four and 4.5 percent...I would say that five percent is more likely now than it was a couple of months ago,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
